  "content": "\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花奶牛花\" title=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花奶牛花\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成为赞助者\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"维基\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Friends & Foes - 繁花奶牛花是 Friends & Foes 模组的一个小型附加模组，为每种花朵添加了一种对应的奶牛花变体。奶牛花可生成于草地和花林地生物群系中。你可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">维基</a>以了解更多关于奶牛花的详细信息。</span>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>🐮 奶牛花变体</h1>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>大花葱</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>勿忘草</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"大花葱奶牛花\" title=\"大花葱奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" width=\"146\" alt=\"勿忘草奶牛花\" title=\"勿忘草奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>蓝色兰花草</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>矢车菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"蓝色兰花草奶牛花\" title=\"蓝色兰花草奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" width=\"139\" alt=\"矢车菊奶牛花\" title=\"矢车菊奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>蒲公英</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>丁香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"蒲公英奶牛花\" title=\"蒲公英奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"丁香奶牛花\" title=\"丁香奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>铃兰</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>橙色郁金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" width=\"140\" alt=\"铃兰奶牛花\" title=\"铃兰奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"橙色郁金香奶牛花\" title=\"橙色郁金香奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>滨菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>牡丹</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" width=\"134\" alt=\"滨菊奶牛花\" title=\"滨菊奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"牡丹奶牛花\" title=\"牡丹奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>粉色郁金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>虞美人</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"粉色郁金香奶牛花\" title=\"粉色郁金香奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"虞美人奶牛花\" title=\"虞美人奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>红色郁金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>玫瑰丛</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"红色郁金香奶牛花\" title=\"红色郁金香奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"玫瑰丛奶牛花\" title=\"玫瑰丛奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>向日葵</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>白色郁金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"向日葵奶牛花\" title=\"向日葵奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"白色郁金香奶牛花\" title=\"白色郁金香奶牛花\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 其他附加模组 / 兼容数据包</h1>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\">Friends & Foes - 养蜂人小屋</a></li>\t\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社区</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我们的 Discord 社区</a>，在这里你可以聊天交流、分享作品、提出任何问题，或仅为了获取模组的最新开发动态并在有新版本发布时收到通知。如果遇到问题，也请通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\">GitHub Issues 报告崩溃或 Bug</a>，我们非常感谢你的反馈。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h2>👋 支持</h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">无论是否获得支持，我都会继续开发我的模组，因为这是我的爱好，尽管我大多数的空闲时间都投入在模组开发上。所以如果你仍然希望支持我，可以通过 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 进行资助。话虽如此，我非常感激大家的所有支持。</span></p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 许可证</h1>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模组采用 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 许可证授权。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">你可以随意浏览我的代码，参考我在编写此模组时如何实现和解决各种问题的示例，并将相关片段融入你自己的代码中。同时也欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组（不过如果能注明出处或链接回本页将不胜感激）。</span>\n</p>",
